# Send only build inputs to Docker; credentials and runtime state stay outside.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.in
!requirements.lock
!README.md
!DEPLOYMENT.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-SCOPE.md
!BRANDING.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!SECURITY.md
!trader/
!trader/*.py
!trader/static/
!trader/static/*.html
!tests/
!tests/*.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.log
